<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκέτης</span>
			, <i>inmate of one's house,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ . . φίλους οἰκῆας ἐγείρῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.413
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.366
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.533
			</span></i> ; but elsewh., as in <i><span class="en">
				4.245
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.4
			</span></i>, al., =
			<i>menial, servant,</i> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				10.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				756
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.33
			</span></i> ; <i>serf,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Leg.Gort.
				2.8
			</span></i>, al. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝοικ-</span>).</div>
